00:53:42.487 --> 00:53:44.695
- I mean, rightly so.

00:53:44.695 --> 00:53:46.135
- Companies aren't normally known for

00:53:46.135 --> 00:53:47.345
going back on contracts.

00:53:47.345 --> 00:53:48.237
(all laughing)

00:53:48.237 --> 00:53:52.154
