00:54:03.945 --> 00:54:06.363
it just worked out perfectly,
the timing was good.

00:54:06.363 --> 00:54:08.745
And then, I left, I did Crunchyroll

00:54:08.745 --> 00:54:11.515
and that was when my own, personal channel

00:54:11.515 --> 00:54:12.774
was doing quite well.

00:54:12.774 --> 00:54:14.460
Probably, because they wanted to

00:54:14.460 --> 00:54:15.979
