00:54:15.979 --> 00:54:16.928
(guys humming in agreement)

00:54:16.928 --> 00:54:20.085
But, also, I had some
like nice people watching,

00:54:20.085 --> 00:54:22.127
and they were like migrated
over to my channel,

00:54:22.127 --> 00:54:23.276
which was really nice.

00:54:23.276 --> 00:54:25.357
And then, you know, I announced

00:54:25.357 --> 00:54:26.325
that I was going to Crunchyroll.

00:54:26.325 --> 00:54:27.168
So, they were like,

00:54:27.168 --> 00:54:28.766
"Oh, it's going to be
even more anime-centric."

00:54:28.766 --> 00:54:30.563
