00:54:35.027 --> 00:54:36.888
- Reina Scully, "Why I Left Crunchyroll."

00:54:36.888 --> 00:54:37.721
- Yeah!

00:54:37.721 --> 00:54:39.907
I mean, I wanted to do that video so bad.

00:54:39.907 --> 00:54:41.972
(all laughing)

00:54:41.972 --> 00:54:43.227
