I was just kind of done.

00:54:45.985 --> 00:54:47.746
"They're a nice company
though, great guys.

00:54:47.746 --> 00:54:48.579
"But yeah, I was done."

00:54:48.579 --> 00:54:49.636
And then it's like a million views.

00:54:49.636 --> 00:54:50.936
- Ten million views.

00:54:50.936 --> 00:54:51.854
