00:54:51.854 --> 00:54:53.194
- I mean, yeah, I should've.

00:54:53.194 --> 00:54:57.035
Crunchyroll was a little
bit of a different break up.

00:54:57.035 --> 00:54:59.366
It wasn't aggressive
or anything like that,

00:54:59.366 --> 00:55:04.265
it's just I still wanted to
work adjacent around them,

00:55:04.265 --> 00:55:06.846
and also, because they're
so deeply embedded

00:55:06.846 --> 00:55:09.086
in the Japanese anime community,

00:55:09.086 --> 00:55:13.596
