00:55:25.065 --> 00:55:28.208
And I was afraid that even if
it wasn't anything negative,

00:55:28.208 --> 00:55:31.676
if I did kind of like a "Why
I Left Crunchyroll" thing,

00:55:31.676 --> 00:55:33.830
