02:17:32.833 --> 02:17:33.753
Right?

02:17:33.753 --> 02:17:34.992
Instead of a stroller.

02:17:34.992 --> 02:17:36.005
(guys agreeing)

02:17:36.005 --> 02:17:37.204
Like, in America, it's a stroller, right?

02:17:37.204 --> 02:17:38.037
You put your baby in a stroller?

02:17:38.037 --> 02:17:38.893
- [Reina] Yeah, yeah, yeah.

02:17:38.893 --> 02:17:39.877
- In Australia, we call it a pram.

02:17:39.877 --> 02:17:41.644
